[{"x": 0.21643043793828776, "y": 0.031513080023709734, "text": "WRITING", "w": 0.137801021999783, "h": 0.01916860762916325}, {"text": "Expressing an opinion, presenting", "h": 0.015174417977728975, "x": 0.21288013928220714, "w": 0.25402504814995663, "y": 0.07207848870662968}, {"h": 0.010697246777021458, "y": 0.08822695813021597, "x": 0.21459794936924936, "text": "arguments", "w": 0.08064309861924912}, {"x": 0.08407871910443346, "y": 0.13530523266129021, "text": "1 Put paragraphs A-E in the correct order.", "w": 0.314847920735677, "h": 0.012704694839160872}, {"w": 0.030411449008517805, "x": 0.094812164918818, "text": "900", "h": 0.008851743820341951, "y": 0.15806686075861534}, {"y": 0.17703488418613553, "text": "The Lindon Observer", "x": 0.09838998645685611, "w": 0.22003577338324654, "h": 0.015338762314310962}, {"x": 0.3416815747110411, "text": "WITH OUR TOWN?", "y": 0.18452166062203565, "w": 0.10375670539008247, "h": 0.007851985559566706}, {"w": 0.3615120103624132, "h": 0.01174000474089747, "text": "Your chance to send your ideas about how to improve Lindon.", "x": 0.10009644379293497, "y": 0.19849605360739822}, {"x": 0.3827935666935049, "y": 0.21738264988185482, "text": "Ray, aged 16", "w": 0.08056671142578126, "h": 0.011615514299069075}, {"y": 0.22761627926775826, "text": "AU", "x": 0.09838998317417481, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.044722718132866754}, {"y": 0.22888081388222262, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "x": 0.1466905325842083, "w": 0.31305901421440974, "text": "Also, there is a lot to do. We have good shops,"}, {"h": 0.013314911269108784, "text": "cafés and restaurants. There is a cinema, a", "w": 0.2847812228732639, "x": 0.14653478678554255, "y": 0.24231239702433344}, {"x": 0.14311270027894832, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.3005366685655382, "text": "theatre and an art gallery. I go to a very good", "y": 0.25670058132092166}, {"x": 0.14669053029509996, "w": 0.30948120117187505, "y": 0.27187500014574734, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "sports centre once a week. I know there aren't"}, {"text": "any concerts here and some teenagers say it's", "x": 0.14669052838131505, "h": 0.01141276953452761, "y": 0.2857848838927993, "w": 0.30769229465060766}, {"y": 0.29837545112422187, "text": "boring but I disagree.", "x": 0.14311270185752142, "w": 0.14669052124023432, "h": 0.012700130009909388}, {"text": "B", "w": 0.012522361543443467, "h": 0.01138081348329678, "x": 0.09660107336512978, "y": 0.3148691864238676}, {"text": "People always think their town should be better,", "x": 0.14293157858573827, "y": 0.31468899487320684, "w": 0.31344631618923613, "h": 0.015436495039006886}, {"text": "but I don't think anyone is really unhappy here.", "x": 0.14311270856984543, "y": 0.33004360491238044, "h": 0.012695564431834262, "w": 0.3041144816080729}, {"text": "In my view, it's simply impossible!", "x": 0.14132379550873453, "y": 0.3439169678792819, "h": 0.012681869195256459, "w": 0.22003577338324654}, {"x": 0.09660107349476851, "w": 0.01431127018398709, "y": 0.3603924420062124, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "C"}, {"x": 0.14311271390834818, "w": 0.31127010769314234, "y": 0.3615839351708973, "h": 0.011453855244261213, "text": "I realise that people may disagree with me, but"}, {"h": 0.010116278651819317, "y": 0.375566860642477, "w": 0.29874776204427084, "x": 0.14311270589646913, "text": "I think our town is a nice place to live and I'm"}, {"text": "going to try to explain why.", "y": 0.38945848392948873, "w": 0.17889087253146702, "h": 0.010207581227436872, "x": 0.14311270505805895}, {"y": 0.4059156978201659, "w": 0.012522361543443467, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "D", "x": 0.096601073357676}, {"y": 0.40465116320998207, "text": "U", "h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.0161001788245307, "x": 0.11627906991242158}, {"x": 0.1431127050858176, "y": 0.4059156979474504, "text": "Finally, the countryside outside the town is", "w": 0.28085866292317707, "h": 0.011417334363779093}, {"w": 0.314847920735677, "x": 0.14311271436382508, "y": 0.4196886279512071, "text": "beautiful. You can swim in the lakes, walk in the", "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"h": 0.013909883895075349, "text": "forests and, in the winter, you can go skiing in", "x": 0.13953488534051778, "w": 0.30590338812934026, "y": 0.43373546485533304}, {"x": 0.14132379538257833, "y": 0.4475631767143338, "h": 0.011462985651587822, "w": 0.21288013034396702, "text": "the mountains just 50 km away."}, {"w": 0.012522361543443467, "y": 0.4653488373424043, "x": 0.09481216461289366, "text": "E", "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"y": 0.4652301443711652, "h": 0.012955776173285286, "text": "Firstly, it's safe. The people are friendly and there", "x": 0.14132380208435621, "w": 0.30769229465060766}, {"x": 0.14132379005166704, "h": 0.011490376124743525, "text": "aren't any real problems here. I can go out at", "y": 0.4792587212285551, "w": 0.2844364929199219}, {"text": "night and I don't have to worry. The schools are", "x": 0.1395348849562498, "h": 0.012709260417235902, "w": 0.304114481608073, "y": 0.4931046928605}, {"w": 0.2468694051106771, "text": "excellent and the park is very pleasant.", "x": 0.1413237988757883, "h": 0.011545157445466848, "y": 0.5070784886704155}, {"w": 0.37388193766276034, "x": 0.07334525286808322, "y": 0.5538662788435961, "text": "2 Complete the text with the words from the box.", "h": 0.013909883895075349}, {"text": "There are three extra words.", "w": 0.21142747667100698, "h": 0.012239700409479496, "x": 0.09821671045824416, "y": 0.5682626498061335}, {"w": 0.20751341078016494, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "text": "addition all finally first", "x": 0.11627907415672724, "y": 0.5943313958208106}, {"w": 0.11275765313042535, "x": 0.3201864672861273, "text": "firstly opinion", "y": 0.5942261408114307, "h": 0.015384927295175268}, {"text": "secondly seems think view", "y": 0.6067043647822955, "w": 0.22581020779079863, "h": 0.01511468580913882, "x": 0.11427701534683567}, {"w": 0.028622540367974167, "h": 0.0075872089888644875, "text": "900", "x": 0.08586762040635279, "y": 0.6385901164863818}, {"y": 0.6562936048923647, "text": "The Lindon Observer", "x": 0.0894454451229671, "w": 0.2379248555501302, "h": 0.015174417977729072}, {"text": "Your chance to send your ideas about how to improve Lindon.", "x": 0.09123434627110757, "y": 0.6776263537526178, "w": 0.35957065158420143, "h": 0.010280622613989482}, {"x": 0.36996379640644433, "text": "Lucy, aged 17", "y": 0.6964611835053166, "w": 0.08493337843153209, "h": 0.012030246559032905}, {"x": 0.0894454445686356, "text": "In my opinion, our town centre is unattractive because", "h": 0.010230406496929367, "w": 0.343470458984375, "y": 0.7094040699764158}, {"text": "there are so many cars. Why is this a problem?", "x": 0.08765653123670934, "y": 0.7231678703541141, "w": 0.29695885552300344, "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"text": "of 2", "h": 0.011549722649130153, "x": 0.18246869439561936, "y": 0.7359593025132571, "w": 0.02862254036797418}, {"w": 0.15742396036783857, "x": 0.28980322750838833, "h": 0.011389943890623196, "text": "., the air is polluted. I can", "y": 0.7384792418733725}, {"x": 0.08765653766943769, "y": 0.7510424185736815, "text": "taste the pollution when I go to the town centre. The air is", "h": 0.0127366508903917, "w": 0.3595706515842014}, {"x": 0.08765653167704954, "y": 0.7650436048280781, "w": 0.2701252237955729, "h": 0.012695565180658001, "text": "cleaner in bigger cities which are car free. 3"}, {"y": 0.7789169676986339, "w": 0.33452592637803824, "h": 0.012681869195256459, "x": 0.08765653830599748, "text": "it is dangerous. The cars go very fast and there aren't"}, {"h": 0.011572548293034468, "text": "many places to cross the road. In 4", "x": 0.08765653580802923, "y": 0.7928633722174723, "w": 0.22182467990451388}, {"x": 0.08755457890333503, "y": 0.8066501456420485, "text": "old buildings are always dirty and it costs a lot of money", "w": 0.3508190239800347, "h": 0.014090363884660777}, {"x": 0.08586762053095763, "w": 0.10375670539008246, "y": 0.8193546932214355, "h": 0.011444725211346617, "text": "to clean them. 5"}, {"w": 0.1466905212402344, "x": 0.2701252205516181, "h": 0.011453855244261213, "y": 0.8232122096480683, "text": "., tourists enjoy walking"}, {"h": 0.011394509094286404, "y": 0.8358438628774492, "text": "around quiet, clean towns. It•", "w": 0.18962432861328124, "x": 0.08586762030874398}, {"text": "to me that", "y": 0.8370226033278462, "w": 0.0716121758355035, "h": 0.010315257956405, "x": 0.3595427498874969}, {"h": 0.012955776173285286, "y": 0.8495848376771202, "w": 0.3452593994140625, "x": 0.08586761980698182, "text": "we don't get many tourists, because they don't like the"}, {"y": 0.047897112266470976, "w": 0.406082288953993, "text": "3 Write which picture shows Lindon from Ray's text (R)", "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.5259391826026097}, {"w": 0.22182467990451393, "y": 0.06196220956354313, "x": 0.5491949967919291, "text": "and which from Lucy's text (L).", "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"x": 0.5491949910529651, "w": 0.01252236154344355, "h": 0.010116278651819317, "y": 0.08345930263571824, "text": "A"}, {"text": "FOCUS | Environment protection", "y": 0.16428708882802215, "x": 0.5238746665964383, "w": 0.24737309773763017, "h": 0.01618066479583081}, {"y": 0.18585232284237063, "w": 0.40980648464626734, "h": 0.014087208341605371, "text": "4 Match sentence beginnings 1-6 with their endings a-f.", "x": 0.5240767381147926}, {"x": 0.5706619035372584, "w": 0.22361358642578122, "text": "When you brush your teeth, turn", "h": 0.012732085312316574, "y": 0.20359011675104313}, {"h": 0.008851743820341854, "w": 0.008944543202718092, "x": 0.547406082513131, "y": 0.21750000003532322, "text": "1"}, {"y": 0.2175000003244444, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "x": 0.5688729883124821, "w": 0.11091233995225691, "text": "It's good to buy"}, {"text": "Try to throw", "w": 0.08634634229871951, "x": 0.5686336275602178, "h": 0.014382566123232434, "y": 0.23054127463552196}, {"h": 0.01141276953452761, "y": 0.24655234643568177, "text": "It's important to plant", "x": 0.5688729897459142, "w": 0.1502683342827691}, {"y": 0.2592296512571256, "x": 0.547406082513131, "w": 0.008944543202718092, "h": 0.008851743820341854, "text": "4"}, {"w": 0.18246868557400175, "y": 0.25911552351484046, "text": "Before you go to bed, turn", "x": 0.5706619023292782, "h": 0.011494941328406732}, {"y": 0.27313953512430833, "x": 0.5688729873680278, "w": 0.08944543626573342, "text": "You can save", "h": 0.010116278651819414}, {"w": 0.1288014305962456, "x": 0.5474060838432009, "text": "6 You should sort", "y": 0.2869900722386572, "h": 0.010207581227436775}, {"w": 0.24686940511067712, "h": 0.012654478722100659, "x": 0.5456171738906961, "text": "a water by taking shorter showers.", "y": 0.3034792417361586}, {"text": "b away less and find other ways to use what you have.", "x": 0.5456171689012791, "y": 0.31722021629125535, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "w": 0.3810375637478298}, {"text": "c trees because they produce oxygen for the atmosphere.", "y": 0.33253158843202074, "w": 0.3881931898328993, "h": 0.012686434773331489, "x": 0.5456171810823576}, {"w": 0.2772808498806424, "y": 0.3450947656811581, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "text": "d off the lights in the rest of the house.", "x": 0.5456171825432803}, {"w": 0.3738819037543403, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "e your rubbish for recycling - you know, glass, paper", "y": 0.35912790682644496, "x": 0.543828285123426}, {"x": 0.5670840775301821, "w": 0.10912343343098962, "text": "and aluminium.", "y": 0.3741471119454162, "h": 0.010271492581074886}, {"h": 0.014152621086754037, "text": "f recycled things, like paper for your printer.", "x": 0.5437093472274288, "y": 0.38691417789072097, "w": 0.30611589219835067}, {"h": 0.012659043551352046, "x": 0.543828265038616, "text": "g off the tap water so that you don't waste it.", "w": 0.318425767686632, "y": 0.4008438631641746}, {"y": 0.4298962095965919, "w": 0.24329159206814233, "x": 0.5313059058442829, "h": 0.012690999602582876, "text": "SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT"}, {"h": 0.014287653468576243, "y": 0.45513085910753553, "x": 0.5258462324237406, "text": "5 You also live in Lindon and find it boring and not", "w": 0.36868940565321184}, {"y": 0.46914244215878775, "h": 0.011399073923537888, "x": 0.5438282570947275, "text": "a good place for teenagers to live. You have decided", "w": 0.37209303114149306}, {"y": 0.4817193139799815, "h": 0.011449290415009824, "x": 0.5420393610557608, "w": 0.32379248725043397, "text": "to present your views about the town on the"}, {"text": "The Lindon Observer website. Write an opinion", "x": 0.5436486383654323, "w": 0.33489593505859383, "h": 0.015339503649770169, "y": 0.49220878840395216}, {"text": "essay.", "x": 0.5420393583944595, "w": 0.046511624654134165, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "y": 0.5108720931850326}, {"w": 0.31305901421440974, "h": 0.011421899567442204, "x": 0.5402504610278576, "y": 0.5260465118155827, "text": "• state what you think the main problem with"}, {"h": 0.01045297262470637, "x": 0.554520923071279, "y": 0.5397880483883726, "text": "the town is.", "w": 0.0823713938395183}, {"text": "• give reasons for your opinion.", "y": 0.5538662792922179, "h": 0.011476680888165624, "w": 0.22003577338324654, "x": 0.5402504518235823}, {"y": 0.5676985557128758, "x": 0.5402504608137554, "text": "• put forward ideas for possible changes.", "w": 0.28622538248697915, "h": 0.012722955653813801}, {"h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.2379248555501302, "text": "• explain why your ideas can help.", "x": 0.5384615465764553, "y": 0.5816860464087488}, {"h": 0.012955776173285189, "text": "SHOW THAT YOU'VE CHECKED", "x": 0.5241502710217841, "y": 0.6206994583457748, "w": 0.2504472181532118}, {"text": "Finished? Always check your writing.", "y": 0.6461773254816775, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "x": 0.5241502771435197, "w": 0.2665473937988282}, {"w": 0.2701252237955729, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.5241502655798523, "text": "Can you tick / everything on this list?", "y": 0.6587815884826997}, {"x": 0.5241502698625405, "y": 0.6764485558709424, "text": "In my opinion essay:", "w": 0.1484794277615018, "h": 0.012722955653813801}, {"text": "• I have included a short introduction expressing", "w": 0.3437685818142362, "x": 0.5257877166927722, "y": 0.6965483532341392, "h": 0.014616604230033843}, {"h": 0.012679248312320085, "w": 0.08441143459743916, "x": 0.5472397201445173, "text": "my opinion.", "y": 0.7138129917994364}, {"w": 0.3595706515842013, "text": "• I have used phrases to introduce my opinions such", "h": 0.011504071735733246, "x": 0.524150277986969, "y": 0.7309011629783735}, {"text": "as In my opinion/view, It seems to me, etc.", "x": 0.5473148119755643, "h": 0.013853440560158437, "y": 0.7438154602068592, "w": 0.28466050889756944}, {"x": 0.5241502713857678, "h": 0.012732085312316574, "y": 0.7624277979366403, "w": 0.3363148328993055, "text": "• I have clearly ordered my ideas using phrases"}, {"y": 0.7764244183437051, "x": 0.5456171708173583, "text": "such as In addition, First of all, Finally, etc.", "h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.2915921359592014}, {"y": 0.7965839352444392, "w": 0.35420393202039935, "h": 0.01271839007573877, "x": 0.5223613554567057, "text": "• I have given arguments to support my opinions."}, {"x": 0.5223613658952074, "w": 0.32915920681423616, "text": "• I have explained why my my suggestions are", "h": 0.011408204330864402, "y": 0.8181540699646018}, {"w": 0.08247456020779076, "x": 0.5473137048242122, "y": 0.8317205918255793, "text": "good ideas.", "h": 0.012067537230274697}, {"h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "• I have finished the essay appropriately.", "y": 0.8522965115566411, "w": 0.2915921359592014, "x": 0.5205724508710252}, {"text": "people need transport but I think cycle paths, buses and", "y": 0.8779069769728015, "w": 0.35390943739149305, "h": 0.011810448330650147, "x": 0.08641977046749066}, {"text": "trams are more environmentally friendly than cars.", "y": 0.8908948195968119, "x": 0.08436214826998385, "w": 0.3127571953667535, "h": 0.011773940345368938}, {"y": 0.9375000000971094, "h": 0.01162790690711002, "x": 0.06790123427880235, "w": 0.03497942394680448, "text": "104"}, {"text": "• I have checked my spelling.", "y": 0.8735465116361947, "x": 0.520576130890822, "w": 0.21193415323893228, "h": 0.013081394896215293}, {"y": 0.896781789746174, "x": 0.5205761377235444, "w": 0.19547324286566847, "h": 0.011773940345368938, "text": "• My text is neat and clear."}]